    "updated_at": "2021-03-22T16:32:55Z",
    "body": "> I would also like to suggest replacing indexes with indices everywhere in the code base. What do you think?\r\n\r\nEither are accepted as plural of index. If things are consistent everywhere I guess that would be good. If its in comments I would think its very low priority to change - for a param name etc., i.e. something that would end up in users code, then it would be good to have things consistent - do we have that where its a parameter name or something?",
